    "Feito por radioamadores, para radioamadores": ["Made by radio amateurs, for radio amateurs", "Hecho por radioaficionados, para radioaficionados", "Fait par des radioamateurs, pour les radioamateurs", "Von Funkamateuren für Funkamateure", "Fatto da radioamatori, per radioamatori"],
    "Obrigado por usar o PT2VHF APRS Client! Conheça também as outras aplicações gratuitas desenvolvidas para a comunidade: Sat Tool, Prop Tool, Mesh Analyzer, Prog Tool, QSL Manager, APRS Client for Android e mais.": ["Thank you for using PT2VHF APRS Client! Check out our other free applications made for the community: Sat Tool, Prop Tool, Mesh Analyzer, Prog Tool, QSL Manager, APRS Client for Android and more.", "¡Gracias por usar PT2VHF APRS Client! Conozca también las otras aplicaciones gratuitas desarrolladas para la comunidad: Sat Tool, Prop Tool, Mesh Analyzer, Prog Tool, QSL Manager, APRS Client for Android y más.", "Merci d’utiliser PT2VHF APRS Client ! Découvrez aussi les autres applications gratuites développées pour la communauté : Sat Tool, Prop Tool, Mesh Analyzer, Prog Tool, QSL Manager, APRS Client for Android et plus encore.", "Danke, dass Sie PT2VHF APRS Client verwenden! Entdecken Sie auch die anderen kostenlosen Anwendungen für die Community: Sat Tool, Prop Tool, Mesh Analyzer, Prog Tool, QSL Manager, APRS Client for Android und mehr.", "Grazie per usare PT2VHF APRS Client! Scopri anche le altre applicazioni gratuite sviluppate per la comunità: Sat Tool, Prop Tool, Mesh Analyzer, Prog Tool, QSL Manager, APRS Client for Android e altro."],
